  "extraction_notes": "Entry 8h shows \"BocHN\" with \"(CH2)3\" in the drawing, but the product 8h is typical Boc-lysine methyl ester formamide, suggesting 4 CH2 groups between N and chiral center. The \"3\" subscript likely refers to 3 CH2 groups plus 1 more CH2 bonded directly to the chiral center = lysine (4 CH2 total). Using lysine structure."
